This package bundles brand icons copied from magpie's own assets
(magpie: https://github.com/yetone/magpie, MIT License).

Those icons originate from lobe-icons (https://github.com/lobehub/lobe-icons),
MIT License, Copyright (c) 2023 LobeHub.
License: https://github.com/lobehub/lobe-icons/blob/master/LICENSE

The token freebies shown at runtime come from AIHOT (https://aihot.news/free-tokens),
fetched directly on each user's machine at runtime. No AIHOT data is bundled with
this package.
